### 🟡 MEDIUM

#### 5. Eager Test
**File:** `OrderProcessorTests.cs` · **Method:** `OrderProcessor_FullWorkflow_Succeeds` (line 52)

```csharp
processor.ValidateOrder(order);
processor.CalculateTotal(order);
processor.ApplyDiscount(order, "SAVE10");
processor.ReserveInventory(order);
processor.ProcessPayment(order, new CreditCard("4111111111111111"));
processor.SendConfirmation(order);
processor.UpdateOrderHistory(order);
```

**7 distinct production methods** called — far above the 4-method threshold.

**Risk:** When this test fails, you cannot quickly identify which step caused the failure.

**Fix:** Decompose into focused unit tests per step, or rename explicitly as an integration test with `[TestCategory("Integration")]`.

